{"id":"260c377f5e1dcfdf","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-product.md","title":"Product","display":"df-product — Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-product","aliases":["93-df-product"],"display":"df-product — Product","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-product — Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is a similarity-type candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> is an index-set candidate, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathbf A:I\\to V\\)</span> is an indexed algebra-family candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1(\\tau)\">\\(\\pi_1(\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_2(\\tau)\">\\(\\pi_2(\\tau)\\)</span> are the symbol set and arity map encoded by the ordered pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> are the predicates of the cited definitions.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProdArg}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProdArg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProdVal}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProdVal}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProdOpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProdOpFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}\\)</span> are the explicit product helpers defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(-;I,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(-;I,\\tau)\\)</span> is the indexed product-algebra constructor defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I)\\coloneqq\n\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathbf A(i)|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I)\\coloneqq\n\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathbf A(i)|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProdArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle k,\\bar a(k)(i)\\rangle:k&lt;n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProdArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle k,\\bar a(k)(i)\\rangle:k&lt;n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProdVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathbf A,I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle i,\nf^{\\mathbf A(i)}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProdArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;\\pi_2(\\tau)(f))\n\\bigr)\\right\\rangle:i\\in I\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProdVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathbf A,I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle i,\nf^{\\mathbf A(i)}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProdArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;\\pi_2(\\tau)(f))\n\\bigr)\\right\\rangle:i\\in I\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\bar a,\n\\operatorname{ProdVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathbf A,I,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle:\n\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\bar a,\n\\operatorname{ProdVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathbf A,I,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle:\n\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProdOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle f,\n\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,I,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle:f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProdOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle f,\n\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,I,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle:f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf A,I)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,a(i)\\rangle:a\\in\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf A,I)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,a(i)\\rangle:a\\in\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I),\n\\operatorname{ProdOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I),\n\\operatorname{ProdOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\tau=\\langle\\pi_1(\\tau),\\pi_2(\\tau)\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(\\pi_1(\\tau),\\pi_2(\\tau))\n\\land I\\in V\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,I,\\tau):\n\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\n\\to\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf A,I):\n|\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)|\\to|\\mathbf A(i)|\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\tau=\\langle\\pi_1(\\tau),\\pi_2(\\tau)\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(\\pi_1(\\tau),\\pi_2(\\tau))\n\\land I\\in V\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A,I,\\tau):\n\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\n\\to\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf A,I):\n|\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau)|\\to|\\mathbf A(i)|\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier, coordinate argument tuple, output tuple, operation graphs, operation-family graph, and coordinate projections are all explicit sets. The constructor records the index set and type even when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\varnothing\">\\(I=\\varnothing\\)</span>, so the empty product still has a determined signature.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":