 product constructor of [[93-df-product]]."},{"id":"87bee95cbaea0934","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}$ and $\\operatorname{ProdOp}_{93}$ are the explicit product carrier and operation graphs of [[93-df-product]]."},{"id":"10bfe2126b30365e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I)$ is the constant indexed algebra family defined here; $\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(-;I,\\tau)$ and $\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}$ are the product and coordinate-projection constructors of [[93-df-product]]."},{"id":"2f5dec406c92aa2e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aa0a957ca4da4328","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}$ and $\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}$ are the product and coordinate-projection constructors of [[93-df-product]]; $\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}$ are the sourced predicates."},{"id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}$ is the explicit product projection of [[93-df-product]]."},{"id":"77d2ef3450d9750f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}$ is the direct-product constructor of [[93-df-product]]."},{"id":"e594c15dd6522ca0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5db3fa00f537080b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1d8f97525e56da1b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5c871aa4b6cc159e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}$ is the product constructor of [[93-df-product]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-product]]